            "text": "noncomputable def axialBackwardStress (C h : ℝ) (f : ℝ → ℝ) (t z r : ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  (∫ s in Ioi (r ^ 2 / 2), SimilarityProfile.partialZ (TerminalStress.canonicalPressure\n    (TerminalStress.swirlCoefficient C h f)) (t, (s, z))) / r"
